  "body": "Enjoying a prime Peninsula position, barely a stone’s throw from the beach, 3 Hattaway Avenue will appeal to investors, developers and land bankers.\r\n\r\nThe existing two level home offers five bedrooms (the master with ensuite), two living areas and a second bathroom. A covered deck enjoys a warm northerly aspect and sea views over nearby Bucklands Beach. A large freestanding garage/workshop is complemented by loads of off-street parking.\r\n\r\nThe wide street frontage, level 731sqm grounds and sought-after Peninsula location combine to create a prime development opportunity. Top schools, beachfront cafes, golf course and marina facilities are all within easy reach.\r\n\r\nIn-zone for Bucklands Beach Primary, Bucklands Beach Intermediate and Macleans College.\r\n\r\nA unique development opportunity in a “blue-chip” location; flexible settlement terms available.",
